{"chunkId":40029,"documentId":1006,"fileName":"缓存使用-FAQ摘编.md","chunkIndex":4,"content":"key 命名：缓存 key 采用业务前缀加主键，禁止包含空格与中文标点。","concepts":["key-naming","cache-key"]}
{"chunkId":40030,"documentId":1006,"fileName":"缓存使用-FAQ摘编.md","chunkIndex":5,"content":"key 过期：默认 TTL 为 10 分钟，可按业务覆盖，最长不超过 24 小时。","concepts":["key-ttl","cache"]}
{"chunkId":40031,"documentId":1006,"fileName":"缓存使用-FAQ摘编.md","chunkIndex":6,"content":"Redis 连接：默认连接超时 2 秒，最大连接数 50，空闲连接会被回收。","concepts":["redis-connection","cache"]}
